  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "這個異次元密阿雷……\n就不能變得氣派一點嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B75706B2151435BC6963F96F720262026000A5C314E0D80FD8B8A5F976C236D3E4E009EDE55CEFF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣就只是個住商混合大樓……\n跟我們在現實中的密阿雷時沒什麼兩樣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A235C3153EA662F500B4F4F55466DF7540859276A1320262026000A8DDF62115011572873FE5BE64E2D76845BC6963F96F766426C924EC09EBC51696A23300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBDFF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBDFF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幹嘛啦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E79561B5566FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你給了我小費，\n幫我把欠款一筆勾消，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我還沒好好地跟你道謝啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F607D664E8662115C0F8CBBFF0C000A5E6B6211628A6B206B3E4E007B4652FE6D88FF0C00100001BE00000A4F46621190846C92597D597D57308DDF4F6090538B1D554A300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你給了我小費，\n幫我把欠款一筆勾消，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我還沒好好地跟你道謝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F607D664E8662115C0F8CBBFF0C000A5E6B6211628A6B206B3E4E007B4652FE6D88FF0C00100001BE00000A4F46621190846C92597D597D57308DDF4F6090538B1D300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金錢的往來\n形同性命的往來！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我只是覺得我們必須是\n對等的關係，才會那麼做的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D1932276845F804F86000A5F62540C6027547D76845F804F86FF0100100001BE01000A621153EA662F89BA5F97621150115FC59808662F000A5C0D7B49768495DC4FC2FF0C624D670390A39EBC505A7684300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與其說那些，既然你們都在，\n那要不要和我們打一場啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "820751768AAA90A34E9BFF0C65E271364F60501190FD5728FF0C000A90A389814E0D8981548C6211501162534E005834554AFF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也沒問題吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF01000A001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F6C92554F984C5427FF1F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也沒問題吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF01000A001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F6C92554F984C5427FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我再想想",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211518D60F360F30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別讓烏羽等啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52258B9370CF7FBD7B49554A300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓烏羽在那邊等，\n有點尷尬吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9370CF7FBD572890A3908A7B49FF0C000A67099EDE5C375C2C5427300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z隊的隊長和王牌一起上陣的話，\n那可是所向無敵啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A968A7684968A9577548C738B724C4E008D774E0A966376848A71FF0C000A90A353EF662F62405411712165755566FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z隊的隊長和王牌一起上陣的話，\n那可是所向無敵！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A968A7684968A9577548C738B724C4E008D774E0A966376848A71FF0C000A90A353EF662F6240541171216575FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望自己是個讓蜈蚣王自豪的男人！\n怎樣？<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意戰鬥吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B81EA5DF1662F500B8B93870886A3738B81EA8C6A768475374EBAFF01000A600E6A23FF1F00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F62309B255427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望能再次在烏羽先生\n面前展現我是個可靠的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B80FD518D6B21572870CF7FBD5148751F000A9762524D5C5573FE6211662F500B53EF976076844EBA300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趕快打一打吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D955FEB62534E0062535427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次我一定打到讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳哭！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B2162114E005B9A625352308B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B354EDFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的心如鋼鐵般堅定不已，\n不論得等多久，我都行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845FC3598292FC9435822C58055B9A4E0D5DF2FF0C000A4E0D8AD65F977B49591A4E45FF0C621190FD884C300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟事關烏羽先生的面子，\n我可是一點也不會放水的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF4E8B95DC70CF7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A621153EF662F4E009EDE4E5F4E0D6703653E6C347684300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽他們也在等，\n我們趕快來寶可夢對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBD4ED650114E5F57287B49FF0C000A621150118D955FEB4F865BF653EF59225C0D62305427FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽他們也在等，\n我們趕快來寶可夢對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBD4ED650114E5F57287B49FF0C000A621150118D955FEB4F865BF653EF59225C0D62305427FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蜈蚣王！跟你一起的話，\n就算是這種局面也能笑著度過！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "870886A3738BFF018DDF4F604E008D7776848A71FF0C000A5C317B97662F90197A2E5C4097624E5F80FD7B1184575EA6904EFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級進化所產生的連結……\n就讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識一下盔甲鳥的美吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A9032531662407522751F768490237D5020262026000A5C318B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B584E004E0B76D475329CE576847F8E5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為有<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n讓我們也能突破極限！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA670900100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A8B93621150114E5F80FD7A81783469759650FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為有<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在，\n讓我們也能突破極限！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA670900100003110000FF01014F6059B35728FF0C000A8B93621150114E5F80FD7A81783469759650FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和烏羽他們的對戰，\n真是又刺又痛呢……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C70CF7FBD4ED6501176845C0D6230FF0C000A771F662F53C8523A53C875DB546220262026FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和烏羽他們的對戰，\n真是又刺又痛的……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C70CF7FBD4ED6501176845C0D6230FF0C000A771F662F53C8523A53C875DB768420262026FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是在ZA登峰戰頂尖的2個人。\n看來我們的默契還差得遠呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F5728005A0041767B5CF0623098025C1676840032500B4EBA3002000A770B4F866211501176849ED8595190845DEE5F9790605462300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為我的實力不足而導致\n這樣的結果……非常抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA621176845BE6529B4E0D8DB3800C5C0E81F4000A90196A2376847D50679C20262026975E5E3862B16B49300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吉普索你表現的很好。\n我一直很感謝你啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5409666E7D224F60886873FE76845F88597D3002000A62114E0076F45F88611F8B1D4F60554A300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們在現實中的密阿雷也常見面，\n那就趕快解散吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011572873FE5BE64E2D76845BC6963F96F74E5F5E38898B9762FF0C000A90A35C318D955FEB89E365635427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個衣服給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n但我有個請求。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B8863670D7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A4F4662116709500B8ACB6C42300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n烏羽裝扮西裝組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A70CF7FBD88DD626E897F88DD7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z隊和我們之間的恩怨，\n有點不清不楚的對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A968A548C621150114E4B9593768460696028FF0C000A67099EDE4E0D6E054E0D695A76845C0D5427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鏽蝕組可是會讓從河裡跳出來的\n鯉魚王沉到河底，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把正要脫皮的阿柏蛇的皮剝掉，\n是個凶狠到不行的集團！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
